      "body": "\nGoodness me, it really is possible. \n```xml\n    <flexcomp type=\"mesh\" file=\"meshes/slide.STL\" pos=\"0 0 0\" dim=\"2\" euler=\"0 0 0\" rigid=\"true\"\n              radius=\".001\" rgba=\"0 .7 .7 1\" mass=\".05\" name=\"rigidBody\" dof=\"radial\" scale=\"1 1 1\">\n              <contact friction=\"0.1 0.5 0.1\" selfcollide=\"none\" internal=\"false\"/>\n    </flexcomp>\n```\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e0c1507f-4765-4326-94a4-2fc146dfcb5a",
