      "created_at": "2026-06-16T01:30:30Z",
      "updated_at": "2026-06-16T01:30:49Z",
      "body": "> You can increase the memory, ya?\n\n@yuvaltassa \nAfter increasing the memory using the following code, the `The arena memory is full ...` warning disappeared, but the subsequent error persists, and the programme (simulate.exe) terminates.\n```xml\n    <size nconmax=\"30000\" njmax=\"10\" nuserdata=\"10\"/>\n```\n\n<img width=\"1277\" height=\"684\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f53f6fe8-d89c-401f-9e18-75f0f3c1eb51\" />\n",
